<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 17.4 points to 868.5 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 17.4 points to 868.5 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 17.4 points on Wednesday to 868.5, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Eight of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the transport index falling the most, down 42.5 points, or 3.17 percent, to 1,298.4 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
